// PARAMETERS
//  PARAM NAME        RANGE  DESCRIPTION              DEFAULT UNITS
//  ID                1+     ID (source number)       1
//  SOURCES           1+     No. of interupt sources  8
//  PRIORITIES        1+     No. of priority levels   8
